    {
      "id": "hsk1_8_g_duoshao",
      "number": 2,
      "title": {
        "hanzi": "疑问代词“多少”和“几”",
        "english": "Asking numbers: 多少 vs 几"
      },
      "explanation": {
        "hanzi": "“几”一般用来问比较小的数字（常常是十以下），后面要有量词。“多少”可以问任何数字，后面的量词可以不用。问价钱用“多少钱”。",
        "english": "Both 几 and 多少 ask \"how many\". Use 几 when you expect a small number (usually under ten); it must be followed by a measure word (几个, 几口). Use 多少 for any number, especially large or unknown ones; the measure word after it is optional. To ask a price, always say 多少钱."
      },
      "examples": [
        {
          "hanzi": "你想买几个杯子？",
          "pinyin": "Nǐ xiǎng mǎi jǐ ge bēizi?",
          "english": "How many cups do you want to buy?"
        },
        {
          "hanzi": "王明家有几口人？",
          "pinyin": "Wáng Míng jiā yǒu jǐ kǒu rén?",
          "english": "How many people are in Wang Ming's family?"
        },
        {
          "hanzi": "你们学校有多少老师？",
          "pinyin": "Nǐmen xuéxiào yǒu duōshao lǎoshī?",
          "english": "How many teachers does your school have?"
        },
        {
          "hanzi": "那个杯子多少钱？",
          "pinyin": "Nàge bēizi duōshao qián?",
          "english": "How much is that cup?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "hsk1_8_g_measure",
      "number": 3,
      "title": {
        "hanzi": "量词“个”和“口”",
        "english": "Measure words 个 and 口"
      },
      "explanation": {
        "hanzi": "汉语里，数字和名词中间要用量词：数词 + 量词 + 名词。“个”是最常用的量词；“口”用来说家里有几个人。“这”“那”后面也常常用量词：这个杯子、那个老师。",
        "english": "In Chinese, a number cannot go straight before a noun: you need a measure word in between (number + measure word + noun). 个 is the most common, all-purpose measure word. 口 is used when counting the members of a family (三口人). 这 and 那 also usually take a measure word before the noun: 这个杯子 (this cup), 那个老师 (that teacher). Note that 个 is usually read in the neutral tone (ge), and 一 changes to yí before it."
      },
      "examples": [
        {
          "hanzi": "我想买一个杯子。",
          "pinyin": "Wǒ xiǎng mǎi yí ge bēizi.",
          "english": "I want to buy a cup."
        },
        {
          "hanzi": "这个商店很大。",
          "pinyin": "Zhège shāngdiàn hěn dà.",
          "english": "This shop is big."
        },
        {
          "hanzi": "那个老师是谁？",
          "pinyin": "Nàge lǎoshī shì shéi?",
          "english": "Who is that teacher?"
        },
        {
          "hanzi": "安娜的中国朋友家有五口人。",
          "pinyin": "Ānnà de Zhōngguó péngyou jiā yǒu wǔ kǒu rén.",
          "english": "Anna's Chinese friend has five people in the family."
        }
      ],
