    {
      "id": "hsk1_8_g_money",
      "number": 4,
      "title": {
        "hanzi": "钱数的表达",
        "english": "Saying amounts of money with 块"
      },
      "explanation": {
        "hanzi": "人民币的单位是元、角、分，口语里常说“块、毛、分”。一块 = 十毛，一毛 = 十分。说钱数：数字 + 块（+ 钱）。",
        "english": "China's currency is the yuan (元). In everyday speech people say 块 instead of 元: number + 块, optionally followed by 钱 (25块 or 25块钱). Smaller units also exist — 1块 = 10毛 (written 角), 1毛 = 10分 — but in daily shopping you will mostly hear 块."
      },
      "examples": [
        {
          "hanzi": "这个杯子15块。",
          "pinyin": "Zhège bēizi shíwǔ kuài.",
          "english": "This cup is 15 yuan."
        },
        {
          "hanzi": "米饭3块钱。",
          "pinyin": "Mǐfàn sān kuài qián.",
          "english": "Rice is 3 yuan."
        },
        {
          "hanzi": "一个杯子九块钱。",
          "pinyin": "Yí ge bēizi jiǔ kuài qián.",
          "english": "One cup costs nine yuan."
        },
        {
          "hanzi": "茶多少钱？——20块。",
          "pinyin": "Chá duōshao qián? —— Èrshí kuài.",
          "english": "How much is the tea? — 20 yuan."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
